    sources: [{ label: 'Card: Highborn Vampire (ZNR #107) 한국어판 \'고귀한 흡혈귀\' — \'자유로운 자들과 노예가 된 자들 간의 전투에서 혈족장들이 절멸하자, 말라키르 주변의 늪은 두각을 드러내고자 하는 젊고 위험한 흡혈귀들로 득실거렸다.\'', url: 'https://scryfall.com/card/znr/107/ko' }, { label: 'Zendikar: Things Have Changed (2020-09-01) — \'the last living bloodchief\', \'only a bloodchief can create a new vampire\'', url: 'https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/feature/zendikar-things-have-changed-2020-09-01' }, { label: 'The Legends of Zendikar Rising (2020-09-15) — Drana: \'makes Guul Draz particularly dangerous for non-vampire visitors\'', url: 'https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/feature/legends-zendikar-rising-2020-09-15' }],
