    flavor: '"You can almost see it calculating—are we a tasty enough treat to risk the jump?"\n—Samila, Murasa Expeditionary House',
    sources: [{ label: 'Card: Canopy Baloth (ZNR #182) 한국어판 \'숲 발로스\' — \'"저게 우리한테 뛰어들 위험을 감수할 정도로 우리가 맛있을까 하고 머리를 굴리는 걸 볼 수 있을 거야." —무라사 탐험단의 사밀라\'', url: 'https://scryfall.com/card/znr/182/ko' }, { label: 'Plane Shift: Zendikar (James Wyatt, 2016) — Baloths: \'muscular, omnivorous hunters covered in horns, spines, and plates\'; \'leaping from tree to tree\'', url: 'https://media.wizards.com/2016/downloads/magic/Plane%20Shift%20Zendikar.pdf' }, { label: 'A Planeswalker\'s Guide to Zendikar: Murasa and Sejiri (2010) — Jaddi Trees: \'whole species of creatures live and die in their canopy\'', url: 'https://web.archive.org/web/20210917155519/https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/savor-flavor/planeswalkers-guide-zendikar-murasa-and-sejiri-2010-02-24' }],
