    flavor: 'Elves of the Tajuru Nation spend their lives in the ancient jaddi trees\' expansive canopy, some living and dying without ever touching the ground.',
    sources: [{ label: 'Card: Tajuru Snarecaster (ZNR #210) 한국어판 \'타주루 그물사냥꾼\' — \'타주루 국가의 엘프들은 자디 숲의 넓은 숲 지붕 위에서 그들의 삶을 보내는데, 일부는 죽을 때까지 땅에 발을 한 번도 대지 않고 살기도 한다.\'', url: 'https://scryfall.com/card/znr/210/ko' }, { label: 'A Planeswalker\'s Guide to Zendikar: Murasa and Sejiri (2010) — Kazandu: \'a broken landscape dominated by tangles of the mountainous jaddi trees\'; Jaddi Trees: \'These enormous plants support whole ecosystems and villages of elves upon their limbs\'', url: 'https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/feature/a-planeswalkers-guide-to-zendikar-murasa-and-sejiri' }, { label: 'Reclamation (2016-01-06) — 무라사의 타주루 땅', url: 'https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/feature/reclamation-2016-01-06' }],
