    flavor: 'It will happily carry home your treasure or drag you back to civilization, as circumstances demand.',
    sources: [{ label: 'Card: Stonework Packbeast (ZNR #255) 한국어판 \'돌로 만들어진 등짐야수\' — \'그것은 상황에 따라서 기꺼이 당신이 발견한 보물을 집까지 옮겨 주거나 아니면 당신을 문명세계로 다시 끌고 가 줄 것이다.\'', url: 'https://scryfall.com/card/znr/255/ko' }, { label: 'A Planeswalker\'s Guide to Zendikar: Akoum (2010) — Affa: \'a launching point for glory seekers who wish to head out to the ruins\'; Goma Fada: \'Huge packbeasts and hurda giants pull enormous carts\'', url: 'https://web.archive.org/web/20210429061411/https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/savor-flavor/planeswalker%E2%80%99s-guide-zendikar-akoum-2010-01-13' }, { label: 'Magic Story: Episode 1: In the Heart of the Skyclave (A. T. Greenblatt, 2020-09-02) — \'A lava field was spread out before her feet\'', url: 'https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-1-heart-skyclave-2020-09-02' }, { label: 'Zendikar: Things Have Changed (Ari Zirulnik·James Wyatt, 2020-09-01) — \'full of traps and treasure\'', url: 'https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/feature/zendikar-things-have-changed-2020-09-01' }],
